{
  "outcome": "patch",
  "edits": [
    {
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "replacement_lines": [
        "interface Request { payload: string; sku: string; quantity: string }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 9,
      "replacement_lines": [
        "    const sample = StockItem.encode({ sku: request.sku, quantity: request.quantity }).finish();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 10,
      "replacement_lines": [
        "    const fields = { sku: entity.sku, quantity: entity.quantity.toString() };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 11,
      "replacement_lines": [
        "    return { fields, in_stock: entity.quantity > 0n, constructed_payload: Buffer.from(sample).toString(\"base64\") };"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "The schema change widens quantity from int32 to int64. With ts-proto forceLong=string, the generated StockItem.quantity is a string. Line 9 must pass the canonical decimal string directly instead of converting to number (which would lose precision for >2^53 values). Line 11 must compare the string quantity as BigInt to preserve strict >0 predicate for 64-bit values. Lines 4 and 10 are unaffected but included in edits to satisfy the constraint that every candidate marked edit must be covered by an edit; they are replaced with identical content.",
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "assumptions": [
    "ts-proto is configured with forceLong=string for int64 fields",
    "request.quantity is already a valid canonical decimal string (no leading zeros except '0', optional leading '-')",
    "entity.quantity from decode() is a string per forceLong=string",
    "BigInt comparison with string coerces correctly per ES2020",
    "No other files require changes per the task scope"
  ],
  "candidate_reviews": [
    {
      "line": 4,
      "decision": "edit",
      "reason": "Conservative syntax candidate for property signature; Request.quantity remains string as canonical decimal input per intended behavior. No type change needed but must be covered by edit per constraints."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "decision": "edit",
      "reason": "Encodes quantity field; must pass string directly to StockItem.encode() because generated field is string (forceLong=string). Number.parseInt would truncate >2^53 values."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "decision": "edit",
      "reason": "Reads entity.quantity (string) and calls .toString() which is idempotent; preserves canonical decimal string output. Covered by edit per constraints."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "decision": "edit",
      "reason": "Compares quantity > 0; must use BigInt(entity.quantity) > 0n or entity.quantity > 0n (coercion) to correctly handle 64-bit values. BigInt wrapper removed as redundant since string > 0n coerces per spec."
    }
  ]
}
